# Retired 2026-07-28: merged into pre-pr-review
#
# Why: this skill and pre-pr-check shared the same territory (report-only
# review of the implemented branch diff before the PR), and the description
# seams between them were the root cause of repeated routing defects
# (verbatim trigger collision, one-sided mutual exclusion, colliding
# deliverable names). In practice both ran on the same branch anyway.
#
# Where things went: the expert perspectives live on as pre-pr-review's
# add-on mechanism. references/perspectives.md and evals 1-3 moved to
# claude/skills/pre-pr-review/ (eval 4 was dropped — its fixture
# inputs/findings.md was never committed).
#
# To revive: deleting this file is NOT enough (unlike weekly-report, the
# assets moved). Restore references/ from git history, then delete this
# file and re-run claude/sync-links.sh. But reviving re-creates the
# routing collision with pre-pr-review — reconsider before doing so.
